Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Disables MPO (hardware overlay planes) so desktop screenshot tools
; (PrtScn, Snipping Tool, Lightshot) can see game frames again.
; Double-click to merge (needs admin), then REBOOT.
; Side effect: video playback uses slightly more GPU. Reversible with
; restore-overlay-planes.reg in this folder.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\Dwm]
"OverlayTestMode"=dword:00000005
